docs {
Koreksi kontribusi MAKNA tanpa publish (publish=false) - "koreksi
saja": definisi + terjemahan diganti penuh, is_corrected true, TAPI
status makna tetap "pending_review" dan contributions.status TETAP
"pending" (tanpa review row). Kontribusi masih di antrean - bisa
di-approve atau dikoreksi lagi.

200 sukses:

  {
    "success": true,
    "data": {
      "contribution_id": "01JDContribution0000000003",
      "entity_type": "meaning",
      "entity_id": "01JDMeaning00000000000000",
      "status": "pending",
      "is_corrected": true
    }
  }

Setelah ini makna BELUM tayang di GET /words/:id.
}

meta {
  name: Correct Contribution Meaning (Tanpa Publish)
  seq: 9
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/contributions/{{meaning_contribution_id}}/correct
  body: json
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{access_token}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "entity_type": "meaning",
    "publish": false,
    "comment": "Perbaiki definisi (belum tayang)",
    "word_class_id": null,
    "definition": "Bagian kepala untuk melihat",
    "translations": [
      {
        "language_id": "{{indonesian_language_id}}",
        "translation_text": "mata",
        "translation_type": "direct"
      }
    ]
  }
}

tests {
  test("200 + status pending + is_corrected true (belum tayang)", () => {
    expect(res.status).to.equal(200);
    expect(res.body.data.status).to.equal('pending');
    expect(res.body.data.is_corrected).to.equal(true);
    expect(res.body.data.entity_type).to.equal('meaning');
  });
}
